msgstr "Generated once using OAuth Playground or a script — used for automatic token renewal. Requires the scope https://www.googleapis.com/auth/adwords."

#: templates/settings-page.php:589
msgid "Bemaerk: Google lukker UploadClickConversions for NYE developer tokens fra 15. juni 2026 (Data Manager API er afloeseren). Eksisterende tokens fortsaetter."
msgstr "Note: Google is closing UploadClickConversions for NEW developer tokens from June 15, 2026 (the Data Manager API is the successor). Existing tokens continue to work."

