msgstr "ISO-2 country code (e.g. DK, SE, DE). Used to normalize phone numbers without an international prefix for Google's enhanced conversions. Empty means: use the WooCommerce base country, otherwise DK."

#: templates/settings-page.php:1759
msgid "Kundedata (EC/AM)"
msgstr "Customer Data (EC/AM)"

#: templates/settings-page.php:1762
msgid "Del kundedata"
