#: templates/settings-page.php:1769
msgid "Send hashede kundedata (e-mail, telefon, navn, adresse) til Googles forbedrede konverteringer og Metas Advanced Matching."
msgstr "Send hashed customer data (email, phone, name, address) to Google's enhanced conversions and Meta's Advanced Matching."

#: templates/settings-page.php:1772
