msgstr "Enabled by default. Disable if the site operates in a sensitive industry (health, finance/credit, sexuality, religion, politics, etc.) — Google's customer data policy prohibits enhanced conversions in sensitive areas."

#: templates/settings-page.php:1773
msgid "Læs Googles kundedatapolitik"
msgstr "Read Google's customer data policy"

#: templates/settings-page.php:1779
msgid "Betroede proxyer"
