msgstr "One CIDR block per line (IPv4 or IPv6). Only IP addresses in this list (or Cloudflare's, see below) are allowed to set CF-Connecting-IP/X-Forwarded-For — otherwise REMOTE_ADDR is used directly."

#: templates/settings-page.php:1797
